WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:09.840
Fresh cranberries can be bounced like a rubber
ball.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:16.309
Luna moths have no mouths; they live off the
energy they stored when they were a caterpillar.

00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:23.420
A study found that women look their oldest
at 3:30pm every Wednesday.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.160
This is because this is when women are typically
under the most stress at work and have the

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.880
lowest energy levels.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.770
When the moon is directly overhead, you weigh
slightly less.

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:40.500
At birth, Polar bear can weigh as little as
500 grams, so small that you can hold in one

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.500
in your hands.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:47.720
But at maturity, Polar bears can weigh as
much as 500 kgs.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:50.120
Who owns space?

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:55.990
No one - The Outer Space Treaty, signed by
all major space faring nations, prohibits

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:59.829
claiming territory in space or on celestial
bodies.

00:00:59.829 --> 00:01:03.610
Space is considered “the shared heritage
of mankind”.

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:07.990
You can start a fire with ice.

00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:13.270
In the U.S., if you find a bald eagle feather
on the ground, you need a permit to pick it

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:14.270
up.

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:20.100
The sun evaporates about a trillion tons of
water a day.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:25.189
Whenever a pregnant women suffers from organ
damage like a heart attack, the foetus sends

00:01:25.189 --> 00:01:27.579
stem cells to the organ helping it to repair.

00:01:27.579 --> 00:01:28.579
Women can get pregnant while they're already
pregnant.

00:01:28.579 --> 00:01:29.579
This rare phenomenon is called superfetation.

00:01:29.579 --> 00:01:35.689
The ashes of one in 50 people who are cremated
are never collected by relatives.

00:01:35.689 --> 00:01:41.850
Disney Parks developed a paint colour that's
meant to help things visually disappear by

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:44.969
tricking the eye into ignoring it.

00:01:44.969 --> 00:01:50.950
They named it “Go Away Green” - a bland,
natural blue-green colour used on unsightly

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:55.939
park structures like fences, garbage bins
and admin buildings to help them blend in

00:01:55.939 --> 00:02:01.509
with the landscape.

00:02:01.509 --> 00:02:12.000
An attosecond is one billionth of a billionth
of a second.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:18.360
Dogs and elephants are the only animals that
understand pointing.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:33.550
France is no longer the world's biggest wine
producer, Italy has overtaken it.

